,"source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o160a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7bb648ea3f82596e3b9b","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，魏将文钦伪叛以诱朱异〖18〗；权遣吕据〖19〗，就异以迎钦。异等持重，钦不敢进。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o158","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-781d2f88aede8a4f2628","layer":"original","quote":"十三年夏五月〖10〗，日至〖11〗，荧惑入南斗〖12〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"zhulv-q-cf607a0f8e666484e8d5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f41415dcb4091f1fcd47","layer":"original","quote":"权诏曰：“方今北土未一，钦云欲归命〖5〗，宜且迎之。若嫌其有谲者，但当设计，网以罗之，盛重兵以防之耳！”乃遣吕据督二万人，与异并力；至北界，钦果不降","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":112},{"id":"zhulv-q-d9d9c4d54c53c63f8545","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f41415dcb4091f1fcd47","layer":"original","quote":"十三年〖4〗，文钦诈降；密书与异，欲令自迎。异表呈钦书，因陈其伪，不可便迎","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
